  "description": "The BULLS Iconic EVO 2 Speed is built for riders who want to conquer long-distance routes and zip through urban traffic with power and ease. With a sleek design and robust components, this eBike is made for serious commuting and thrilling rides alike.\n\nMotor and Battery\n\nMotor: Bosch Gen4 Performance Speed motor with 85 Nm of torque. Delivers powerful acceleration and smooth assistance, ideal for fast-paced urban rides and extended treks.\n\nBattery: Bosch PowerTube 625 Wh, fully integrated into the frame. Offers long-range performance with a full charge time of around 4.9 hours.\n\nSuspension and Frame\n\nFork: SR Suntour Lytro 35 Supreme SL Boost with 120mm of travel. Designed to absorb bumps and keep you rolling smooth.\n\nFrame: Lightweight aluminum 6061 with internal cable routing. Available in multiple sizes for a perfect fit.\n\nDrivetrain and Brakes\n\nGears: Shimano Deore 10-speed drivetrain for reliable shifting across a range of inclines and surfaces.\n\nBrakes: Tektro HD-M390 hydraulic disc brakes with 203mm rotors front and rear, delivering solid stopping power.\n\nWheels and Tires\n\nWheels: 27.5\" wheels for balanced handling and maneuverability.\n\nTires: Supero All Ground 2.4\" wide tires for grip and control on varied terrain.\n\nAdditional Features\n\nDisplay: Bosch Kiox display with easy-to-read ride stats including speed, battery level, and distance traveled.\n\nPedals and Saddle: Equipped with Wellgo C-098DU pedals and a BULLS e-Zone saddle for comfort and control.\n\nTechnology and Design\n\nMonkeyLink Ready: Integrated mounting points for lights and accessories make customization a breeze.\n\nClass-3 eBike: Pedal-assist up to 28 mph, perfect for fast commutes and longer excursions.\n\nThe Iconic EVO 2 Speed is a premium eBike that delivers performance, versatility, and modern tech for riders who want to go farther, faster, and in style.",
